{"page":396,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"390","words":[{"text":"390","x":204,"y":132,"width":76,"height":37}]},{"text":"CHAPTER05 • 네트위크 계층. 제어 평면","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER05","x":579,"y":135,"width":163,"height":26},{"text":"•","x":775,"y":142,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"네트위크","x":819,"y":137,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"계층.","x":932,"y":136,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"제어","x":1006,"y":136,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"평면","x":1068,"y":136,"width":50,"height":30}]},{"text":"request ID 필드(그림 5.21 참조)는 관리 서버가 에이전트에 보내는 요청에 번호를 매","words":[{"text":"request","x":555,"y":272,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"ID","x":677,"y":268,"width":38,"height":28},{"text":"필드(그림","x":731,"y":263,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"5.21","x":886,"y":267,"width":60,"height":30},{"text":"참조)는","x":968,"y":263,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"관리","x":1091,"y":262,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"서버가","x":1174,"y":262,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"에이전트에","x":1288,"y":260,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"보내는","x":1476,"y":262,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"요청에","x":1596,"y":262,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"번호를","x":1718,"y":262,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"매","x":1828,"y":268,"width":24,"height":36}]},{"text":"기기 위해서 A卜\u0026된다. 에이전트의 응답은 수신된 요청으로부터 Request ID 값을 취","words":[{"text":"기기","x":557,"y":321,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"위해서","x":637,"y":322,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"A卜\u0026된다.","x":748,"y":322,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"에이전트의","x":903,"y":321,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"응답은","x":1083,"y":321,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"수신된","x":1200,"y":321,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"요청으로부터","x":1319,"y":321,"width":205,"height":39},{"text":"Request","x":1544,"y":327,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"ID","x":1691,"y":327,"width":42,"height":28},{"text":"값을","x":1751,"y":321,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"취","x":1829,"y":327,"width":24,"height":36}]},{"text":"한다. 따라서 Request ID 필드는 관리 서버가 요