"y":502,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"특히,","x":1465,"y":502,"width":79,"height":38},{"text":"SNMP","x":1559,"y":506,"width":109,"height":29},{"text":"표준은","x":1682,"y":503,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"재전","x":1798,"y":504,"width":57,"height":39}]},{"text":"훈을 위한 특별한 절치를 규정하지 않는다. 심지어 재전송이 되어야 하는지 어떤지도","words":[{"text":"훈을","x":549,"y":559,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"위한","x":631,"y":560,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"특별한","x":711,"y":560,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"절치를","x":826,"y":561,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"규정하지","x":937,"y":561,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":1087,"y":561,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"심지어","x":1213,"y":561,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"재전송이","x":1331,"y":562,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"되어야","x":1488,"y":563,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"하는지","x":1609,"y":562,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"어떤지도","x":1731,"y":562,"width":125,"height":38}]},{"text":"말이다. 표준은 단지 관리 객체가 “재전송의 빈도와 기간에 대해 책임 있게 행동할 필","words":[{"text":"말이다.","x":549,"y":618,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"표준은","x":672,"y":621,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"단지","x":784,"y":621,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"관리","x":864,"y":621,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"객체가","x":946,"y":621,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"“재전송의","x":1058,"y":621,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"빈도와","x":1223,"y":621,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"기간에","x":1341,"y":622,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":1460,"y":623,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"책임","x":1546,"y":622,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"있게","x":1632,"y":622,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"행동할","x":1717,"y":623,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"필","x":1828,"y":627,"width":25,"height":36}]},{"text":"요가 있다”고만 요구한다. 이는 물론 “책임 있는” 프로토콜이 어떻게 행동해야 하는지","words":[{"text":"요가","x":548,"y":679,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"있다”고만","x":631,"y":680,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"요구한다.","x":788,"y":681,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"이는","x":944,"y":681,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"물론","x":1024,"y":683,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"“책임","x":1104,"y":682,"width":78,"height":37},{"text":"있는”","x":1202,"y":681,"width":80,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":1297,"y":683,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":1489,"y":683,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"행동해야","x":1610,"y":682,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"하는지","x":1764,"y":683,"width":88,"height":40}]},{"text":"궁금하게 만든다!","words":[{"text":"궁금하게","x":547,"y":741,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"만든다!","x":693,"y":741,"width":108,"height":38}]},{"text":"SNMP는 세 가지 버전으로 발전했다. SNMPv3의 설계자는 \"SNMPv3은 추가적","words":[{"text":"SNMP는","x":612,"y":805,"width":137,"height":35},{"text":"세","x":763,"y":802,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"가지","x":810,"y":802,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"버전으로","x":891,"y":802,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"발전했다.","x":1037,"y":802,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"SNMPv3의","x":1194,"y":804,"width":180,"height":38},{"text":"설계자는","x":1392,"y":804,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"\"SNMPv3은","x":1549,"y":805,"width":200,"height":36},{"text":"추가적","x":1762,"y":805,"width":89,"height":40}]},{"text":"인 보안 및 관리 기능-을 갖춘 SNMPv2로 생각할 수 있다”IRFC 3410]고 했다. 분명히","words":[{"text":"인","x":548,"y":861,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"보안","x":592,"y":863,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":673,"y":863,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"관리","x":717,"y":864,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"기능-을","x":797,"y":864,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"갖춘","x":908,"y":863,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"SNMPv2로","x":985,"y":868,"width":177,"height":29},{"text":"생각할","x":1175,"y":864,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1290,"y":865,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있다”IRFC","x":1341,"y":865,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"3410]고","x":1526,"y":870,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"했다.","x":1671,"y":866,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"분명히","x":1761,"y":867,"width":89,"height":39}]},{"text":"SNMPv3에는 SNMPv2로부터의 변화가 있지만, 이러한 변화가 관리 및 보안 영역보","words":[{"text":"SNMPv3에는","x":545,"y":925,"width":210,"height":37},{"text":"SNMPv2로부터의","x":769,"y":924,"width":270,"height":38},{"text":"변화가","x":1059,"y":925,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"있지만,","x":1175,"y":925,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":1302,"y":926,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"변화가","x":1422,"y":926,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"관리","x":1542,"y":926,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"및","x":1630,"y":927,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"보안","x":1678,"y":927,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"영역보","x":1764,"y":927,"width":90,"height":38}]},{"text":"다 더 명확한 곳은 없다. 적절한 보안 기능의 부족으로 인해 SNMP가 주로 제어보다는","words":[{"text":"다","x":546,"y":984,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":593,"y":985,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"명확한","x":638,"y":986,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"곳은","x":748,"y":986,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"없다.","x":828,"y":986,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"적절한","x":914,"y":985,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"보안","x":1024,"y":986,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"기능의","x":1105,"y":986,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"부족으로","x":1217,"y":987,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"인해","x":1371,"y":987,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"SNMP가","x":1451,"y":988,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"주로","x":1610,"y":990,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"제어보다는","x":1694,"y":988,"width":161,"height":39}]},{"text":"모니터링 용도로만 A卜\u0026되어 왔기 때문에(예를 들면 setRequest는 SNMPv1에서","words":[{"text":"모니터링","x":545,"y":1047,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"용도로만","x":693,"y":1047,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"A卜\u0026되어","x":841,"y":1046,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"왔기","x":988,"y":1047,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"때문에(예를","x":1072,"y":1047,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"들면","x":1268,"y":1048,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"setRequest는","x":1355,"y":1051,"width":278,"height":38},{"text":"SNMPv1에서","x":1649,"y":1051,"width":202,"height":38}]},{"text":"거의 사용되지 않음) SNMPv3에서는 보안의 역할이 특히 중요하다. 다시 한번 우리는","words":[{"text":"거의","x":546,"y":1107,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"사용되지